- TEAM VERIFIED
- LIVE API DATA
- CALCULATED FROM PROVIDED DATA
- PLACEHOLDER
- NOT AVAILABLE

Display this statement prominently in the footer and About page:

"Original work made in Autodesk Forma - no AI-generated content."

